WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:03.700
Your Mac. Now with a little more personality.

00:04.460 --> 00:08.900
Meet Iris, your personal AI sidekick, made by AriZe.

00:09.560 --> 00:14.100
Call from the notch, open a conversation,
or let Iris float right beside you.

00:14.500 --> 00:17.140
Speak naturally. Watch answers arrive.

00:17.500 --> 00:22.640
Get guidance on screen, draft a reply,
and work with files in folders you allow.

00:23.160 --> 00:25.820
Bring your notes and connected sources together.

00:25.820 --> 00:30.260
Turn ideas into images, PDFs, and useful creations.

00:30.840 --> 00:34.520
In Studio, study with summaries,
flashcards, and mind maps.

00:34.960 --> 00:38.040
Or build websites, plan projects, and review code.

00:38.440 --> 00:40.200
Keep your creations in the Library.

00:40.200 --> 00:43.040
Choose your AI provider, voice, personality, and theme.

00:43.340 --> 00:47.060
From everyday questions to your next big idea,
Iris helps you keep moving.

00:47.500 --> 00:49.160
Your Mac. With company.
